     10. The method of  claim 1 , wherein the inorganic hard mask has a thickness of between about 200 Å to about 500 Å. 


     11. The method of  claim 1 , wherein the photodefinable material has a thickness of between about 500 Å to about 1500 Å. 


     12. A method of fabricating a memory device, the method comprising:
